                            (on vocals and guitar) and his whipping boy.<br><br><a
                                href="https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DPL2eMSVsLfY&amp;h=ATNBM3Odfo9v_0Nm0Uu7ouSN2zSlRwwo8ynIbXYYpB53StLUrw2YZRpwMg5atnNTq7M3LlvyE9MfZmXNZu6bB8GVP7_ObgVy0npKHCOpbkQlnldyUf7jEcpPn6OPY07L3k7L">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PL2eMSVsLfY</a><br><br><br><strong>DREHSCHEIBE
