                        <p>It’s all true! After a five year break there’ll be another Claws of Saurtopia Fest this
                            year—on June 1 and 2, 2018 to be exact. In order to prepare you and us for this noise
                            banquet, we’ll do some support shows. Here’s the first:</p>
