                            </strong>[crapcore / Brln]<br><br> Berlin’s unsound blackened noise punks CUNTROACHES are
                            back in town again. Feat. members of <a
                                href="https://m.facebook.com/BATALJBATALJBATALJ/">BATALJ</a>!<br><a
                                href="https://lm.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fcuntroaches.bandcamp.com%2F&amp;h=ATNqEfMns7HMPRaW6qmCCSXZbd_EYPFpwboKcMRaLtFDJ19zO-laTspEnWU4qfES2O8ly-08t6YdEQFrdSrRN7bZ2phBZ3RJ0r7QjQR0AmW-kKQQ9Gnt8Ba4q1fEQlJDGnAZ">https://cuntroaches.bandcamp.com</a><br><br><br><strong>
                                Urin </strong>[d-beat, noise / Brln]<br><br> New super group feat. members of PISS,
                            G.L.O.S.S., <a href="https://m.facebook.com/BATALJBATALJBATALJ/">BATALJ</a>, Cuntroaches,
                            Die Pest, Vexx.</p><br><strong>Staxl Oll </strong>[spiritual improv / Leipzig] <a
                            href="https://m.facebook.com/tortellinirecords/">Tortellini Records</a><br><br> Staxl Oll is
                        a transcendental research group from Leipzig city investigating relations between sonic
                        reception and mental drift. As for their most recent project this coalition of 7 to 10 people
                        will employ rhythmic patterns and hardly apperceptive noises to arrive at new results in their
                        studies.<br><br>::::::::::::Aftershow DJ(s) No Income Taxi Drivers ::::::::::::<br><br>This is a
